            "review_title": "Review at Izakaya Kamura",
            "review_text": "TravelingFoodie\nMiami, Florida10830 contributions\n0\nCozy and good\nDec 2025 • Friends\nWe had a very good dinner at Izakaya Kamura in Saigon. The atmosphere is relaxed and feels genuinely Japanese, with a classic izakaya vibe. The menu offers a good range of dishes, all well prepared, nicely balanced and full of flavour. Everything we tried was consistently good, and the service was friendly and efficient. Overall, a reliable and enjoyable spot for quality Japanese food in a casual setting.\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2026",
